  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 156 ÷ 12 − 4 × 65 + 87 = 74\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1): + and −\n\n156 ÷ 12 − 4 × 65 + 87 = 74 ⇒ 156 ÷ 12 + 4 × 65 − 87 = 74\n\n⇒ __**156 ÷ 12**__ + 4 × 65 − 87 = 74\n\n⇒ 13 + __**4 × 65**__ − 87 = 74\n\n⇒ __**13 + 260**__ − 87 = 74\n\n⇒ __**273 −**____** 87**__ = 74\n\n⇒ 186 ≠ 74 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2): = and ×\n\n156 ÷ 12 − 4 × 65 + 87 = 74 ⇒ 156 ÷ 12 − 4 = 65 + 87 × 74\n\n⇒ __**156 ÷ 12**__ − 4 = 65 + __**87 **____**× 74**__\n\n⇒ __**13 − 4**__ = __**65 + 6438**__\n\n⇒ 9 ≠ 6503 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3): × and −\n\n156 ÷ 12 − 4 × 65 + 87 = 74 ⇒ 156 ÷ 12 × 4 − 65 + 87 = 74\n\n⇒ __**156 ÷ 12**__ × 4 − 65 + 87 = 74\n\n⇒ __**13 ×**____** 4**__ − 65 + 87 = 74\n\n⇒ __**52 +**____** 87**__ − 65 = 74\n\n⇒ __**139**____** −**____** 65**__ = 74\n\n⇒ **74 = 74 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 4): + and =\n\n156 ÷ 12 − 4 × 65 + 87 = 74 ⇒ 156 ÷ 12 − 4 × 65 = 87 + 74\n\n⇒ __**156 ÷ 12**__ − 4 × 65 = __**87 + 74**__\n\n⇒ 13 − __**4 × 65**__ = 161\n\n⇒ __**13 − **260__ = 161\n\n⇒ 247 ≠ 161 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
